{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19594","headline":"金谷园怀古 · 张汇","name":"金谷园怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缓步洛城下，轸怀金谷园。\n昔人随水逝，旧树逐春繁。\n冉冉摇风弱，菲菲裛露翻。\n歌台岂易见，舞袖乍如存。\n戏蝶香中起，流莺暗处喧。\n徒闻施锦帐，此地拥行轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张汇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}